{"unit_id":"GengDaPeng__dsh-agent-message#feature-1","repo":"GengDaPeng/dsh-agent-message","commit":"79932887601c9553ef668be93f129cc1527af34b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-message 的功能「查找可联系会话」：列出未归档且非子代理的独立会话，并返回标题、工作目录和运行状态；工具调用后按在线状态及标题排序。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:222-278"]}
{"unit_id":"GengDaPeng__dsh-agent-message#feature-2","repo":"GengDaPeng/dsh-agent-message","commit":"79932887601c9553ef668be93f129cc1527af34b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-message 的功能「跨会话投递」：调用 send_agent_message 将文本发到指定会话；默认创建独立新一轮，在线目标可选择介入或补充上下文，离线目标会尝试恢复后投递，并返回消息 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:280-397"]}
{"unit_id":"GengDaPeng__dsh-agent-message#feature-3","repo":"GengDaPeng/dsh-agent-message","commit":"79932887601c9553ef668be93f129cc1527af34b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-message 的功能「查询投递状态」：通过 check_delivery 按会话和消息 ID 查看排队、已认领、已丢弃或未知状态；需要时读取本地会话事件记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:101-113","lib/index.js:193-220","lib/index.js:400-445"]}
