{"unit_id":"GengDaPeng__dsh-agent-message#feature-5","repo":"GengDaPeng/dsh-agent-message","commit":"79932887601c9553ef668be93f129cc1527af34b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-message 的功能「复制会话 ID」：会话标题操作区提供按钮，使用剪贴板 API 或兼容方式复制当前会话 ID，并提示复制结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:203-258"]}
{"unit_id":"GengDaPeng__dsh-agent-message#caveat-1","repo":"GengDaPeng/dsh-agent-message","commit":"79932887601c9553ef668be93f129cc1527af34b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-message 只处理本地持久化的独立会话；归档会话和子代理不在可发送目标内，且同一会话对每分钟最多投递十条。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-20","lib/index.js:222-229","lib/index.js:332-349","lib/index.js:370-380"]}
